  annotation (Documentation(info = "<html><body><table><tr><td>name:</td><td>dacomitinib</td></tr><tr><td>ATC code:</td><td>L01EB07</td></tr><tr><td>model:</td><td>one compartment, oral dosing <small>(PK_1C_enteral)</small></td></tr><tr><td>source:</td><td>Ruiz-Garcia A et al. 2020</td></tr><tr><td>population:</td><td>healthy volunteers</td></tr><tr><td>measured compound:</td><td>dacomitinib</td></tr><tr><td>review:</td><td>curated candidate</td></tr><tr><td>record page:</td><td><a href=\"https://pharmacolibrary.github.io/#/drugs/drug_dacomitinib/Dacomitinib_RuizGarcia2020_estimate_rse\">pharmacolibrary-docs</a></td></tr></table><h4>Parameters as reported in the paper</h4><table border=1 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=2><tr><th>parameter</th><th>value</th><th>unit</th><th>meaning</th></tr><tr><td>CL (L/h)</td><td>29.2</td><td>L/h</td><td><small>CL</small></td></tr><tr><td>V (L)</td><td>131</td><td>L</td><td><small>V</small></td></tr><tr><td>Q (L/h)</td><td>19.9</td><td>L/h</td><td><small>Q</small></td></tr><tr><td>Vss (L)</td><td>2300</td><td>L</td><td><small>Vss</small></td></tr><tr><td>MTT (h)</td><td>6.91</td><td>h</td><td><small>MTT</small></td></tr><tr><td>ka (h−1)</td><td>0.0246</td><td>h−1</td><td><small>kabs</small></td></tr><tr><td>F</td><td>1</td><td></td><td><small>Fab</small></td></tr><tr><td>tlag (h)</td><td>0.749</td><td>h</td><td><small>tlag</small></td></tr></table><h4>About dacomitinib</h4><p>Dacomitinib is an EGFR tyrosine kinase inhibitor used to treat non-small-cell lung cancer. It is authorised in the European Union for this indication.</p><p><small>Summary written by glm-5.3-flash from <a href=\"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q17130597\">Wikidata Q17130597</a> and the WHO ATC classification and the EMA medicines list; not checked by a person.</small></p><p>Identity, molar mass and metabolites: <a href=\"modelica://Pharmacolibrary.Drugs.Substances.Dacomitinib\">Dacomitinib</a>.</p><h4>References</h4><ol><li><p>Ruiz-Garcia A et al. (2020). Pharmacokine